            <description><![CDATA[<h2>VoiceClaw Companion 0.1.63</h2><ul><li>Synchronizes Companion-created realtime sessions with the latest VoiceClaw iPhone and Apple Watch builds.</li><li>Route switches and live-session restarts now happen immediately instead of presenting stale stop-to-cancel language.</li><li>Tightens runtime contract checks so OpenClaw Bridge and HTTPS Tunnel prompts keep treating OpenClaw as the selected core resource for substantive work.</li></ul>
]]></description>
